## Get auth token
## Admin token: Authorization: Basic YWRtaW46YWRtaW4=
POST http://localhost:4111/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "admin"
}

###
## Positive test: Admin can create user with correct data
POST http://localhost:4111/api/v1/admin/users
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Basic YWRtaW46YWRtaW4=

{
  "username": "{{$random.name.name}}",
  "password": "{{$random.internet.password}}",
  "role": "USER"
}

###

## Negative test: Admin cannot create user with blank username
POST http://localhost:4111/api/v1/admin/users
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Basic YWRtaW46YWRtaW4=

{
  "username": "",
  "password": "{{$random.internet.password}}",
  "role": "USER"
}

###

## Negative test: Admin cannot create user with 2 characters of username
POST http://localhost:4111/api/v1/admin/users
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Basic YWRtaW46YWRtaW4=

{
  "username": "ab",
  "password": "Kate1990!",
  "role": "USER"
}

###

## Negative test: Admin cannot create user with 16 characters of username
POST http://localhost:4111/api/v1/admin/users
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Basic YWRtaW46YWRtaW4=

{
  "username": "abcdefghmknlopqws",
  "password": "Kate1990!",
  "role": "USER"
}

###

## Negative test: Admin cannot create user with username contains $%() character
POST http://localhost:4111/api/v1/admin/users
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Basic YWRtaW46YWRtaW4=

{
  "username": "abcdopqws$",
  "password": "Kate1990!",
  "role": "USER"
}

###

## Negative test: Admin cannot create user with blank password
POST http://localhost:4111/api/v1/admin/users
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Basic YWRtaW46YWRtaW4=

{
  "username": "kate1990",
  "password": "",
  "role": "USER"
}

###

## Negative test: Admin cannot create user with password less than 8 characters
## Negative test: Admin cannot create user with password without 1 digital
## Negative test: Admin cannot create user with password without 1 upper case character
## Negative test: Admin cannot create user with password without 1 lower case character
## Negative test: Admin cannot create user with password without 1 special symbol
## Negative test: Admin cannot create user with password contains space
POST http://localhost:4111/api/v1/admin/users
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Basic YWRtaW46YWRtaW4=

{
  "username": "kate1990",
  "password": "Ka19!",
  "role": "USER"
}

###

## Negative test: Admin cannot create user with role not from list {USER, ADMIN}
POST http://localhost:4111/api/v1/admin/users
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Basic YWRtaW46YWRtaW4=

{
  "username": "kate1990",
  "password": "Kate1990!",
  "role": "EDITOR"
}

###

## Negative test: Admin cannot create user that already exists
POST http://localhost:4111/api/v1/admin/users
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Basic YWRtaW46YWRtaW4=

{
  "username": "kate1990",
  "password": "Kate1990!",
  "role": "USER"
}

###

## Positive test: Authorized user can create account
POST http://localhost:4111/api/v1/accounts
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Basic a2F0ZTE5OTA6S2F0ZTE5OTAh

{}

###

## Positive test: Check customer account was created
GET http://localhost:4111/api/v1/customer/accounts
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Basic a2F0ZTE5OTA6S2F0ZTE5OTAh

###
